# Source-focused learning archive: ignore binaries (including extensionless
# Linux executables), then allow source, sample inputs, and documentation.
*
!*/
!*.c
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.txt
!*.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Local editor settings and generated output stay on this machine.
.vscode/
build/
cmake-build-*/
.cache/

# Never publish local credentials or environment files.
.env*
*.pem
*.key